---
/** Static diagram for post 05: least squares as orthogonal projection onto the column space of A. */
---

<svg
  class="proj"
  viewBox="0 0 520 300"
  width="520"
  height="300"
  role="img"
  aria-label="The measurement vector y, its orthogonal projection A x-hat onto the plane spanned by the columns of A, and the residual r = y minus A x-hat, which is perpendicular to the plane."
>
  <!-- the column space: a plane drawn in perspective -->
  <path class="plane" d="M40 230 L330 270 L490 170 L200 140 Z" />
  <text class="plane-label" x="300" y="248">
    column space of A
  </text>
  <!-- columns a1, a2 -->
  <line class="col" x1="150" y1="200" x2="300" y2="220" />
  <line class="col" x1="150" y1="200" x2="230" y2="160" />
  <text class="lbl" x="304" y="229">
    a₁
  </text>
  <text class="lbl" x="232" y="154">
    a₂
  </text>
  <!-- b, its projection, and the residual -->
  <line class="b" x1="150" y1="200" x2="360" y2="40" />
  <line class="proj-v" x1="150" y1="200" x2="360" y2="190" />
  <line class="res" x1="360" y1="40" x2="360" y2="190" />
  <path class="right" d="M360 176 L346 176.7 L346 190.7" />
  <circle class="dot" cx="150" cy="200" r="3" />
  <text class="lbl" x="368" y="40">
    y (the measurements)
  </text>
  <text class="lbl" x="368" y="205">
    A x̂ (the fit)
  </text>
  <text class="lbl" x="368" y="120">
    r = y − A x̂
  </text>
  <text class="lbl small" x="368" y="137">
    perpendicular to the plane
  </text>
</svg>

<style>
  .proj {
    max-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
  }
  .plane {
    fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--c-prior) 10%, transparent);
    stroke: var(--c-prior);
    stroke-width: 1.25;
  }
  .plane-label {
    fill: var(--c-prior-text);
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .col {
    stroke: var(--c-axis);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  .b {
    stroke: var(--c-meas);
    stroke-width: 2.5;
  }
  .proj-v {
    stroke: var(--c-post);
    stroke-width: 3;
  }
  .res {
    stroke: var(--c-bad);
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-dasharray: 5 4;
  }
  .right {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--c-fg);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }
  .dot {
    fill: var(--c-fg);
  }
  .lbl {
    fill: var(--c-fg);
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .small {
    font-size: 12px;
    fill: var(--c-muted);
  }
</style>
